Z||000005||OcalaFiero||08-21-2001||08:30 AM||||Yep, it's true. The lens is from a 747 wing root landing light. The only place I can recommend to find them would be to find a place that sells aircraft salvage parts (Most will end up being in AZ and NV. I'll try to do some checking and I'll call a few friends that are still in the airline industry. As for the color, I guess you could use the lens as a mold to make a new one or find a way to tint it yellow. I'll get back to you when I hear something.<P>Mike<P>||||reg||1
